{
  "id": "poem-032",
  "body": "<div class=\"poem-text\"><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-1\"><span class=\"poem-line\">把所有别离细分，背后有无数种失去，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">这无数种，苦的程度都不同。</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-2\"><span class=\"poem-line\">修行是为了把失去与执着的相随剥离，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">做到存在失去但不存在痛苦。</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-3\"><span class=\"poem-line\">苦海这个词之所以能成立，是因为一波接一波，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">每一波段都不同，有高也低。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">我们应接不暇，被冲刷击倒。</span></p><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-4\"><span class=\"poem-line\">如想在苦海里乘风破浪，驭苦观景，</span><span class=\"poem-line\">保持平衡是第一要训练的技巧。</span></p></div><figure class=\"poem-illustration\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"poem-art-open\" data-poem-art=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/032.webp\" data-caption=\"《缺失》\" aria-label=\"放大欣赏插画《缺失》\"><img src=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/032.webp\" width=\"885\" height=\"1050\" alt=\"亮子绘制的原书插画《缺失》\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></button><figcaption>《缺失》 · 亮子<span>轻触画面，放大欣赏</span></figcaption></figure><p class=\"poem-original-page\">原书第 32 页</p>"
}
